                                "sense_id": "be2fc21d-816d-3295-862f-ff43b474bbe4",
                                "text": "1831-1850, William Youatt, On the Structure and the Diseases of the Horse\nThe drawing poultices and stoppings of farriers are often highly injurious, instead of abating inflammation ."
                            }
                        ]
